<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>

<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

<title>Happy Meowday Tutu ❤️</title>

<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>

<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Quicksand:wght@400;600;700&family=Cinzel:wght@600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">

</head>

<body>

<div id="background"></div>

<div id="paws"></div>

<div class="container">

<div id="scene1" class="scene active">

<div class="seal">
👑🐾
</div>

<h1>Royal Meowcree</h1>

<p class="subtitle">
A very important document awaits...
</p>

<button id="beginBtn">
Open Royal Decree
</button>

</div>

<div id="scene2" class="scene">

<div class="scroll">

<h2>📜 Royal Meowcree 📜</h2>

<p id="letter"></p>

<button id="blackPaperBtn">
📖 Open the Black Paper
</button>

</div>

</div>

<div id="scene3" class="scene">

<div class="book">

<h2>📖 BLACK PAPER</h2>

<p>
Write the name of anyone who dared hiss at us.
</p>

<input
id="enemy"
type="text"
placeholder="Name...">

<button id="recordBtn">
Record Name
</button>

<div id="recordResult"></div>

<button
id="giftBtn"
style="display:none;">
🎁 Claim Royal Gift
</button>

</div>

</div>

<div id="scene4" class="scene">

<div class="gift">

<h2>🎀 Congratulations! 🎀</h2>

<p>
The Royal Court has prepared
a very special gift...
</p>

<button id="openGift">
Open Gift
</button>

<div id="giftReveal">

<h3>

⭐ ONE YEAR SUBSCRIPTION ⭐

</h3>

<h2>

📺 Harpagon's YouTube Channel

</h2>

<div class="subs">

Subscribers

<div id="count">

1

</div>

</div>

<button id="acceptGift">

Accept Gift

</button>

<div id="giftMessage"></div>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<div id="scene5" class="scene">

<div class="ending">

<h2>

❤️ Happy Meowday, Tutu ❤️

</h2>

<p>

Thank you for always being there.

I hope this year is full of happiness,
cats,
food,
and absolutely nobody worthy
of entering the Black Paper.

Have an amazing birthday!

🐾

</p>

</div>

</div>

</div>

<script src="script.js"></script>

</body>
</html>
